OL,3,GNEWSAHow one man and his sheepdog are
OL,4,Aheading to the world cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeclan McGee and his trusty border
OL,7,Fcollie Chip only began taking part in
OL,8,Fthe hugely competitive world of
OL,9,Fsheepdog trials less than three years
OL,10,Fago.
OL,12,FIn that short space of time they have
OL,13,Fbeen selected to represent their
OL,14,Fcountry and are about to compete in the
OL,15,FWorld Sheepdog Trials.
OL,17,FThe prestigious competition only
OL,18,Fhappens every three years and brings
OL,19,Ftogether the world's best sheepdog
OL,20,Fhandlers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
