OL,3,GNEWSAHow one man and his sheepdog are
OL,4,Aheading to the world cup
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Some people have golf, other people
OL,7,Fplay football, this is my hobby and I
OL,8,Fjust really enjoy it," McGee said.
